OL,3,GNEWSAA day on the front line of the
OL,4,Abattle against shoplifting
OL,5,
OL,6,FStatistics show Peterborough's
OL,7,Fshoplifting rate is higher than the
OL,8,Fnational average. The BBC spent a day
OL,9,Fwith police officers tackling retail
OL,10,Fcrime in the city.
OL,12,FIt's just after 09:00 BST on a Monday
OL,13,Fmorning and at a police station in
OL,14,FPeterborough's Thorpe Wood, news of an
OL,15,Farrest comes in.
OL,17,FA suspect wanted for 10 shoplifting
OL,18,Foffences has been picked up near a
OL,19,Fshopping centre in the city and is
OL,20,Fbeing brought into the custody suite.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
